    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/97998970e459e10d14f064d1a7f0120f.poster.avif?t=1748686322\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/97998970e459e10d14f064d1a7f0120f.webm?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/97998970e459e10d14f064d1a7f0120f.mp4?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Din Dino, the mob's top ex-hitman, runs away from their past to pursue their true passion: <strong>selling custom t-shirts</strong>. It's a new start, a new life. But escaping won't be so easy. Their boss, Al Sapone, shows up and demands that they pay a huge debt if they want to buy their freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Din Dino go back to their shady ways in order to keep their new life? And why is running a crappy t-shirt store so important to them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/b6e03142e23bd7d9ae9501b99d18be0a.poster.avif?t=1748686322\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/b6e03142e23bd7d9ae9501b99d18be0a.webm?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/b6e03142e23bd7d9ae9501b99d18be0a.mp4?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cozy minigames and make full use of your sticker arsenal to create textile masterpieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/d98ec1ab007ac5526d1136bf8e2200fb.poster.avif?t=1748686322\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/d98ec1ab007ac5526d1136bf8e2200fb.webm?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/d98ec1ab007ac5526d1136bf8e2200fb.mp4?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/d36b155671a277a8667cbf9332840fa2.poster.avif?t=1748686322\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/d36b155671a277a8667cbf9332840fa2.webm?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/d36b155671a277a8667cbf9332840fa2.mp4?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out  your clients' tastes, and you might learn something new about them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/b616a17a855750b7c85ba73ffe1a8f59.poster.avif?t=1748686322\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/b616a17a855750b7c85ba73ffe1a8f59.webm?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/b616a17a855750b7c85ba73ffe1a8f59.mp4?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/5b31d64cb5f42b32c799caab8bcaa539.poster.avif?t=1748686322\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/5b31d64cb5f42b32c799caab8bcaa539.webm?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/5b31d64cb5f42b32c799caab8bcaa539.mp4?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face against shadowy figures from Din Dino's past in a wide variety of situations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/89222597b5aac1dd07a6104f93267a19.poster.avif?t=1748686322\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/89222597b5aac1dd07a6104f93267a19.webm?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/89222597b5aac1dd07a6104f93267a19.mp4?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/e8b73b4c2e053427994ba2cf75f87414.poster.avif?t=1748686322\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/e8b73b4c2e053427994ba2cf75f87414.webm?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/e8b73b4c2e053427994ba2cf75f87414.mp4?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide if you'd prefer running a clean business or hiding some dirty laundry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/51cbb4320a11f85a01ab1f255d583f32.poster.avif?t=1748686322\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/51cbb4320a11f85a01ab1f255d583f32.webm?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3082440/extras/51cbb4320a11f85a01ab1f255d583f32.mp4?t=1748686322\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story with multiple endings, based on your decisions and reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design t-shirts for your customers, with many unique sticker designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new stickers and upgrade your t-shirt making machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive each day, overcome your confrontations with the mafia and repay your debt.</p></li></ul>",
